      'the monoamines dopamine reward motivation and movement depleted in parkinsons dysregulated in addiction and psychosis noradrenaline arousal alertness and mood and serotonin mood sleep and appetite the target of ssri antidepressants plus neuropeptides endorphins for pain and gas messengers like nitric oxide the same molecule can excite or inhibit depending on which receptor it hits',
