      'there are some real functional asymmetries lateralization in most people around 95 percent of right handers and 70 percent of left handers the LEFT hemisphere is dominant for language broca and wernicke areas and tends to handle sequential logical analytical processing and arithmetic the RIGHT hemisphere tends to specialise in spatial awareness face recognition the emotional tone of speech prosody and holistic pattern processing',
      'but the popular idea of left brained logical people versus right brained creative people is a myth both hemispheres are active in almost every task and exchange information continuously the differences are relative biases not a split of personality types split brain patients whose corpus callosum was surgically cut reveal the specialisations only in special lab tests',
